media/ugc-layouts.mp4 and .gif: a new edit of the same permitted @hanie.ugc.creator shampoo footage
credited above, rendered in all eight looks with picture-in-picture, split panels, a polaroid
collage, a marquee and a volume callout. This is muted creator-shot b-roll with voice-over
(hybrid), not creator dialogue or synthetic lip-sync. Original music is muted; the existing
ElevenLabs voice, music and sound effects are reused under the repository owner's plan. Product
marks belong to their owner. Claims and the 300 ml volume are read from the packaging; a claim
footnote remains on screen. No source footage or project audio is included outside media/.

